@startuml
title Claude-led team with a native Codex member

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Operator

package "Claude Code team (authoritative control plane)" {
  component "Claude lead\nteam-lead" as ClaudeLead
  component "Claude teammate" as ClaudePeer
  database "Team roster and inboxes\n~/.claude/teams/<team>" as ClaudeTeamStore
  database "Shared task store\n~/.claude/tasks/<team>" as ClaudeTaskStore
}

component "CLAUDE_CODE_TEAMMATE_COMMAND\nengine-selection shim" as Shim

package "Native Codex teammate" {
  component "Codex TUI" as TUI
  component "Codex thread" as Thread
  component "External-team extension" as Extension
  component "Claude Code provider" as Provider
  component "Automation extension" as Automation
  component "Code Mode host" as CodeModeHost
  component "Codex AgentControl\nprivate child graph" as AgentControl
  database "Codex rollout and state" as CodexStore
  database "Automation state" as AutomationStore
}

Operator --> ClaudeLead : direct team instructions
Operator --> TUI : optional direct member input

ClaudeLead --> ClaudeTeamStore : native SendMessage
ClaudePeer --> ClaudeTeamStore : native SendMessage
ClaudeLead --> ClaudeTaskStore : native task operations
ClaudeLead --> Shim : spawn teammate argv
Shim --> TUI : codex teammate

Provider <--> ClaudeTeamStore : roster, messages, lifecycle
Provider <--> ClaudeTaskStore : task operations
Provider <--> Extension : external-team events/API
Extension <--> Thread : Op::InterAgentCommunication
Automation <--> Thread : scheduled/monitor InterAgentCommunication
Automation <--> AutomationStore : loops, cron, monitors, leases
TUI <--> Thread : normal Codex client input/events
TUI --> CodeModeHost : native tool execution
Thread <--> CodexStore : persistence
Thread <--> AgentControl : spawn/message local children

note bottom of Provider
  Only this provider understands
  Claude files and envelope formats.
end note

note bottom of Thread
  Operator input = UserInput
  Claude input = InterAgentCommunication
end note
@enduml
